Sixteen storeys, 69 metres, from the 9th century.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,400
Its two companions? Ten storeys each — even too.

5
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,600
Double-tap if you'd climb all three.

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,600
★ Expert Tip: the twin towers came three centuries later.

